      "type": "histogram",
      "title": "Session wall-time distribution",
      "description": "The distribution of wall_ms taken from kind=run_end Events, one value per Session. Only a replayed or benched Session carries a run_end Event, so a Session recorded live without the Runner is absent from this panel.",
